      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Our expertise in system design engineering of complete SCADA solutions, coupled\nwith our experienced and professional installation knowledge, allows for seamless\ndelivery and implementation. We understand that successful implementation involves\na number of skills, protocols, and technologies. Our experienced field technicians\nensure complete and timely implementation of the client's network solutions with\nminimal disruption to vital business operations and functions.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Our expertise in system design engineering of complete SCADA solutions, coupled\nwith our experienced and professional installation knowledge, allows for seamless\ndelivery and implementation. We understand that successful implementation involves\na number of skills, protocols, and technologies. Our experienced field technicians\nensure complete and timely implementation of the client's network solutions with\nminimal disruption to vital business operations and functions.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
